{"overview":"This story is about a girl, Candy, who is a orphan. She is a nice and optimistic girl and she has a warm heart. When she was a child, she lived in an orphanage called Pony's Home. She had a good friend called Ann. And she met the \"handsome boy on the hill\" who is a important person in her life, on the hill behind the orphanage.\n\nShe was adopted by the Loka's family. What's awaiting her are the bad-hearted Leo and his sister, Eliza. One day, in the rose garden, she met a boy, who is identical to the \"handsome boy on the hill\" who she had met in her childhood. The boy is called Antony. Thereafter, a fantastic story that she has never expected begins.","tagline":"","overview_en":"","tagline_en":"","runtime":25,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":4,"y":1978,"poster":"/2SHWln1rZaPkrTVtasCAa37VLiQ.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":115,"y":1976,"poster":"/nYrg8aYZr2F4SgSi0UAIR6E4c6X.jpg"}],"episodes":115,"crew":["今沢哲男","設楽博","Kyoko Mizuki"],"crew_en":["Tetsuo Imazawa","Hiroshi Shidara","Kyoko Mizuki"],"countries":["JP","US"],"cast":[{"name":"松島みのり","role":"Candice White Ardlay (voice)","photo":"/rhCXXKA6pkExIV63U3IBR73QSqT.jpg","en":"Minori Matsushima"},{"name":"井上真樹夫","role":"William Albert Ardlay (voice)","photo":"/bgKYsgZUPNhbPadTMozuTsTdiGA.jpg","en":"Makio Inoue"},{"name":"富山敬","role":"Terruce G. Granchester (voice)","photo":"/d0ZWVc1fGF6JYJ6hpkK6ciwjQqk.jpg","en":"Kei Tomiyama"},{"name":"井上和彦","role":"Anthony Brown (voice)","photo":"/3BpYtYRiLAmTNbCm2LXlXnkMRit.jpg","en":"Kazuhiko Inoue"},{"name":"肝付 兼太","role":"Alistair Cornwell (voice)","photo":"/mhD9BtpNFg3tDdd9QwTiRVClKf2.jpg","en":"Kaneta Kimotsuki"},{"name":"三ツ矢雄二","role":"Archibald Cornwell (voice)","photo":"/6IguUqrirpkZZSwEkbxrlVMRsEV.jpg","en":"Yuji Mitsuya"},{"name":"小山茉美","role":"Annie Brighton (voice)","photo":"/4KjDxYsa7mMh8gbqSKCV2DixDAx.jpg","en":"Mami Koyama"},{"name":"川島千代子","role":"Patricia O'Brien (voice)","photo":"/uCL7tlnrLjx0Fx1jC0su5WckMoX.jpg","en":"Chiy